## 10. Risks and Mitigations

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| LLM miscounts or mis-clusters | Scripts own counts and fingerprints |
| Unstable fingerprints cause duplicate tickets | Exclude volatile tokens, and test normalization on historical data |
| Wrong diagnosis leads to a bad fix | Gate #1, a confidence threshold, and strict `devin-ready` criteria |
| PII leaks into Jira or Devin | Mandatory masking step, and a check before ticket creation |
| Enrichment is slow or expensive | Run it on the Top-N only, and skip known/ignored clusters |
| Devin lacks context | Self-contained ticket template with acceptance criteria |
| Accidental changes in production | Read-only credentials, `oc` command allowlist, no auto-merge |

